ENGLISH VERSION
================================================================

1. SCOPE

This license applies to the PureLog Minecraft mod (the "Mod"),
including all source code, compiled binaries, assets, and
documentation, EXCEPT where a separate license is explicitly
stated (see Section 5, API License).

2. PLAY RIGHTS (WHAT YOU MAY DO)

Any user who has legally acquired Minecraft may:

  a) Install the Mod on a client or server.
  b) Play Minecraft with the Mod installed, without restriction.
  c) Record videos, stream, or create content featuring the Mod.
  d) Monetize that content (YouTube, Twitch, sponsorships, etc.).
  e) Include the Mod in a modpack, provided that:
       - the modpack is distributed through an approved platform
         (CurseForge, Modrinth, or similar);
       - the Mod is not sold as a standalone product;
       - the Mod's original download link is preserved where
         reasonably possible.
  f) Use the Mod on a monetized Minecraft server, provided that
     players can still obtain the Mod freely from an official
     source.

3. RESTRICTIONS (WHAT YOU MAY NOT DO)

Without prior written permission from the copyright holder:

  a) You may NOT decompile, reverse-engineer, or modify the Mod,
     except as expressly permitted by applicable law.
  b) You may NOT redistribute the Mod's .jar files, source code,
     or assets on any platform not listed in Section 2(e).
  c) You may NOT publish modified versions, forks, ports, or
     continuations of the Mod.
  d) You may NOT extract assets (textures, sounds, logos, text)
     for use in another project.
  e) You may NOT sell, sublicense, or paywall the Mod itself.
  f) You may NOT claim the Mod or its assets as your own.
  g) You may NOT use the PureLog name or branding in a way that
     implies official affiliation or endorsement.

The fact that a Minecraft version is no longer supported, or
that development has slowed or stopped, does NOT automatically
grant permission to redistribute, port, or take over the Mod.

4. LIABILITY

THE MOD IS PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND,
EXPRESS OR IMPLIED. THE COPYRIGHT HOLDER TAKES NO RESPONSIBILITY
FOR ANY DAMAGES ARISING FROM THE USE OR MISUSE OF THE MOD. THE
MOD ALTERS FUNDAMENTAL PARTS OF MINECRAFT; USE AT YOUR OWN RISK.

This license does not override any rights granted or restrictions
imposed by Minecraft's End User License Agreement (EULA) or by
the licenses of third-party dependencies included in the Mod.

5. API LICENSE (SEPARATE)

The packages under `de.ace.purelog.api.*` (the "API") are
licensed under the MIT License, a copy of which is provided
